  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Foes find the wounds you inflict hard to heal.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere (Bleeding Wounds (ghost strike)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Magical healing does not stop your bleed effects unless their caster succeeds at a magical skill check against you. Healing from class features (such as lay on hands) use their class level as their MSB for this purpose. In addition, the DC needed to remove your bleed effects with the Heal skill increases by an amount equal to your caster level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/death#toc80\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
